  unitName: "Rutee (5\u2605)"
  unitId: 20544
  unitNumber: 783
  description: A young woman from another world who became a Swordian Master in command
    of a sentient sword. She is known for her realistic point of view and sharp tongue,
    but rumor has it she hides a softer side to her personality. Not only are her
    skills as a Lens Hunter admirable, but she is also versed in the Magic Artes
    stemming from the Lens Core embedded within the hilt of her Swordian. Rutee eventually
    ends up joining Stahn in his adventures.
  summonDesc: I'll go anywhere for a Lens.<br>I don't care what dangers I face!<br>That's
    the way of a Lens Hunter!
  fusionDesc: I have to get even stronger!<br>I need to save up as much money as
    I can!
  evoDesc: I have to make up for all the power you have given me. I'll pay back double
    what I owe you!
  element: 2
  rarity: 4
